  "stageId": "act11d0_st01",
  "title": "老栎树下",
  "storyCode": "TW-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d0f92bd2d6539592f9d4ee28dc8d41985bf3fbcb99a0aa91a8060468d60c48d3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 纯剧情AVG序章"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "3:23 P.M.    天气/晴\n莱塔尼亚境内，移动城镇沃伦姆德外，一棵微不足道的老栎树下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltruins"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞弗林长官......这已经是您今天的第三包烟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉，伯父......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有依赖烟草的必要。当然，烟草和酒精都是坏东西......你说的对，别学我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但您的咳嗽越来越严重了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没必要这么毕恭毕敬，现在不是工作时间，我和你说过......算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他望向远处，烧毁的帐篷，肆意生长的野草，他抖了抖烟灰。\n他本想在独处的时候获得一些安宁，即使只是通过一个称谓的变化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......他们让你跑这一趟，他们竟然让你来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一群老滑头，他们不敢亲自来找我提意见也就罢了，他们还要伤害一个小姑娘——咳咳、咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伯父，别激动！是我自愿的，是我想着至少要亲自告诉伯父......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——咳咳，咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您真的得戒掉烟酒了，您最近的状态很差......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "结果我大概已经猜得到了——该死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，会上讨论得很激烈。不过年轻人都躲在待客室里，谁也不敢发话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们、他们没有人帮我，对不起，只靠我说服不了其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......自从城镇偏离航线之后情况就紧张了起来。现在不是搞社会实践的时候，学生和年轻人就算发表意见也没人会听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "镇民代表一致认为，因为无法分辨感染者以及他们的感染情况，为了避免意外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尸体必须埋葬在小镇之外，当然也......不允许举办葬礼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我很抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但他们中有人是沃伦姆德的一员，是我们的家人，我们不应该这么简单就抛弃他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃克哈德是最好的裁缝，他接过他爹的裁缝店后，镇上几乎每一次婚礼都少不了他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕德曼是个可怜人，因为大裂谷的事他丢了天灾信使的工作，但他在努力赎罪。他很坚强。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯文不是感染者，他为了他的妻子尽心尽力，他本来是个好丈夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有托尔瓦尔德，他——咳咳，咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不该再抽烟了，长官。托尔也这么说过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你接受吗，孩子？实话实说，别管那些老滑头的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我只想托尔能入土为安，而不是在死后还要被当做危险品......被小心翼翼地处理，被风吹雨打......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么我们要这么对待他们？过去，过去不是这样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有那位矿石病医生。她很了不起，没有抛弃沃伦姆德，这四个人都有权利得到体面的下葬，但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就因为感染者和他们一起——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......该责怪的是这场火灾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......但是这件事得延后，现在还不能抛弃他们的遗体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我联系了最近的宪兵队，他们会在救援队里增派专业人士协助调查，在那之前，尸体都得保存在我照顾得到的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要有专门人士在，我们就可以更合理地对待死者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近？我们还能得到救援......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“最近”。他们可能要一个月——视那条裂缝的具体长度，可能要好几个月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沃伦姆德在脱离原本航线以后情况一天比一天糟糕，大家都说我们得绕过大裂谷往回走，回到正常的航线。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过越过大裂谷要绕的路也太远了，拖得时间太久的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......总之，先等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我和托尔多待一会，我......我有这个权利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果那些老滑头要把我的孩子扔在沃伦姆德之外的荒郊野岭上，就让他们对着他们的士官长开火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对着我，开火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不会的！大家都清楚您对城镇的付出，不至于......不至于的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，忘了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这种情况下，我不能说这种话......士官长不能说这种话。我们应该公事公办。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可托尔毕竟是您的儿子......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔佳娜，你回去告诉他们吧。就说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就说我同意了、咳、我同意了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，咳咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstrongpoint"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "队长，他们回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多亏了这些本地人，我们才能混进附近的城镇里补充资源......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "猎人小队也快回来了，但愿今天能有所收获。我已经吃了两天沙虫了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......水源呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问题。也多亏了那些家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不过说真的，我和他们不是很聊得来。总觉得会被他们小瞧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看样子沃伦姆德近期就打算重新开始迁移，我们必须在那之前得到一个结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们有帮手，会有个好结果的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帮手吗......也许吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我信不过这些本地人，这些感染者......他们只是单纯的想要报复。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莱塔尼亚对待感染者的态度温和得多，既然源石技艺普及率如此之高，这些感染者有什么理由被畏惧被迫害？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而事实上，在这里的感染者至少还能物尽其用，不用被立刻送上绞刑架，这还不够吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看他们只是一群别有用意的暴徒，想利用我们的名号——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "名号？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......名号，又算什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不信任......这没问题，所以......那我们要信任谁？该信任谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别老是说这么吓人的话啊，我当然听你的，队长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，有落叶，落在你头上了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "几箱干肉，捡来的水果，水源。现在是初秋，离入冬还有很久......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们还有时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧，你讲话还是这么让人摸不着头脑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之，我们什么时候上战场，你说了算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "战场？不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看吧，猎人们回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "似乎今晚的伙食会好一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但愿吧。趁现在多吃点肉，入冬之后，我们的伙食会成为大问题的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鲍勃有回信吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自从我们进入莱塔尼亚境内之后就再也没有他们的消息了......呃，还有，我一直有个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他到底是代号“鲍勃”，因为个头很大所以叫“大鲍勃”，还是他一开始就叫“大鲍勃”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......记不得了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "武装的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，反正他们本来就是赏金猎人，说不定已经找到宝藏了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......宝藏，宝藏啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_011",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，如果也有宝藏可以帮帮我们......就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已经二十七天了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那家伙怎么可能拖了这么久没有联络，她可是个出了名的守时狂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托......你在哪里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亚叶姐姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，丽萨......不，现在该叫你铃兰干员了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是个不错的代号喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，谢谢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亚叶姐姐守着通讯室已经二十个小时了，不休息一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有......这么久了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！所以去休息室睡一会吧，我会帮姐姐看着的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧......真的已经这么久了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......还是没有安托姐姐的消息吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......但我已经提出去莱塔尼亚的申请了。如果阿米娅答应的话，我随时出发。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去莱塔尼亚？亚叶姐姐还有其他任务要处理吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是我的同学，也是我最好的朋友，我不会......也不能放着她不管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托最后一次定期联络是在莱塔尼亚北部的办事处，除非有什么特殊情况，她不该离开办事处太远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——那我也要去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶！？这么干脆吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只、只是去调查一下安托姐姐的下落，不会有什么危险吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "视情况，也不一定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系的！我也是正式干员，我也是凯尔希医生的学生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且亚叶姐姐总是愁眉苦脸的，这怎么行！我不放心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉，没想到有一天会被小丽萨担心，最近是不是有点太不在状态了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烦恼这种事情不分年龄大小啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶，好吧！反正我也向本地的分部打了报告，真有什么意外，他们也会帮我们的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等阿米娅同意之后，我们一起去，但是你要时刻和我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即时通讯？是安托姐姐回来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。是一份简报，是莱塔尼亚的干员收到通讯后发来的简报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亚叶姐姐......?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托最后出现在莱塔尼亚当地的某个城镇......而那里在一个月前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遭遇了天灾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
